  "sourceRulesPath": "sources/editorial/lost-object-recovery/directions/source-rules.json",
  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "西南及仓储、方器是变坤的传统取象。发现遗失后先把确知收放理稳，实际用过的盒格可以补看，查询结果随查随记。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.515Z",
      "textSha256": "4faa18e1d5f0be6155c673f5668bc60af9a1299201a9ea4edd8d459aec99eb59"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "兑",
      "text": "方位可参西方，兑列泽畔、破壁。原行程若有相应地段，可请现场管理方核安全可见处及招领记录，物品记号给准便于等实证。",
      "sourceRule": "兑",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.516Z",
      "textSha256": "14971f4e7956c722af6f639d5c8be436495c89bb1ef398e3114aac1a633c0ffb"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "南方是变离的方向，明窗、文书旁可供补查。原来取放若能接到文件台，可先请经手者核收拾经过，把因慌乱漏掉的内容补明。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.516Z",
      "textSha256": "6af05e53b969e1cf634fc43b7a17372855fa81eab232576b756e7d103c0c71ae"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "传统取象落在西南，坤列仓储与方器之中。查找停滞时，可回核真实用过的方盒或储物处，问清谁能实际查看里面。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.516Z",
      "textSha256": "1d56732a7962ab094c58d952a9e23cc7a7742039e43f55afe235ef4e41babb14"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "兑",
      "text": "西方与泽畔、败垣属于变兑的场所象。若原路线确实对应，可向相关管理方核同一次停留，往来查询中的实物细节应保留清楚。",
      "sourceRule": "兑",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.516Z",
      "textSha256": "21904d2b3a6620299b1fd5a10719240e612e3728d4f5f6690479f4da860e02ba"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "方位取南，离有明窗、文书之侧的提示。若新的提醒使人想到旧遗漏，可先核实际用过的文件台，照亲见经过补看可查部分。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.516Z",
      "textSha256": "55f5301b517748b64c9716dea9e4d2897cb8b7b701b800401898a8898f13d9d0"
    }
  ]
